<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>周边收藏 - Reigen Arataka</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1428, #2c1f4a, #1a1428);
            color: #e0d4ff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #d4a5ff;
            font-size: 3em;
        }
        .back {
            color: #ffd700;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1.3em;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .merch-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 40px auto;
        }
        .merch-item {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(212,165,255,0.2);
        }
        .merch-item img {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <a href="index.html" class="back">← 返回首页</a>
    <h1>周边收藏</h1>

    <div class="merch-grid">
        <div class="merch-item">
            <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/reigenswife/reigenarataka/main/_202412151702181.jpg" alt="Reigen 立牌">
            <h3>灵能师立牌</h3>
            <p>限量版 · 21世纪最强</p>
        </div>

        <div class="merch-item">
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=2" alt="西装钥匙扣">
            <h3>西装钥匙扣</h3>
            <p>“相信我，我是专业的”</p>
        </div>

        <div class="merch-item">
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=3" alt="灵能事务所徽章">
            <h3>灵能事务所徽章</h3>
            <p>会员限定</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
